{"id":"serra-catarinense","title":"Serra do Rio do Rastro and the Serra Catarinense","who":"Classic route · southern Brazil's mountain roads by motorcycle","when":"All year (snow is possible in winter, June–August)","vehicle":"Motorcycle, 3–5 days","kind":"moto","color":"#4338ca","summary":"Santa Catarina's mountain loop: 284 curves in 24 km up the Serra do Rio do Rastro, the cold highlands of São Joaquim and Urubici with frost and vineyards, the rock cut of the Serra do Corvo Branco, and canyons at the edge of the Serra Geral. The Corvo Branco is being paved (works due to finish around the end of 2026, with closures of several days while asphalt goes down): check before going.","sources":[{"label":"NSC Total: until when the Serra do Corvo Branco paving works run","url":"https://www.nsctotal.com.br/?p=7482435"},{"label":"Motonline: Serra do Rio do Rastro, a place every rider must know","url":"https://www.motonline.com.br/noticia/serra-do-rio-do-rastro-lugar-que-todo-motociclista-deve-conhecer/"},{"label":"Viagens e Caminhos: Serra do Rio do Rastro","url":"https://www.viagensecaminhos.com/serra-do-rio-do-rastro-sc/"}],"approximate":"A common loop from the coast.","km":387,"bbox":[-49.9351,-28.4652,-48.5494,-27.5846],"stops":[{"name":"Florianópolis","place":"Florianópolis, Santa Catarina","at":[-27.5973,-48.5496],"text":"Island capital and start, south along the BR-101.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Morro_da_Cruz%2C_Florian%C3%B3polis_-_SC%2C_Brazil_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Morro_da_Cruz%2C_Florian%C3%B3polis_-_SC%2C_Brazil_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg","page":"Florianópolis","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Morro_da_Cruz%2C_Florian%C3%B3polis_-_SC%2C_Brazil_-_panoramio_%28cropped%29.jpg","credit":"oscar fava","license":"CC BY 3.0"}},{"name":"Lauro Müller","place":"Lauro Müller, Santa Catarina","at":[-28.3942,-49.3975],"text":"The foot of the serra.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/